(
    title: "Asteroids",
    developer: Some("Brad Stewart"),
    description: Some("The home conversion of Atari\'s arcade classic. You pilot a small ship adrift in a field of asteroids, rotating, thrusting and firing to blast the rocks apart — each large one breaking into smaller, faster fragments — while avoiding both them and the flying saucers that appear and shoot back. A hyperspace jump flings you to a random spot to escape a tight squeeze, at the risk of landing on a rock."),
